# ruff: noqa: E501
"""Seed data for `create_init_objects` - a notebook of interconnected
travel notes for a Peru / South America backpacking trip.

Kept out of the command module because of its length. The leading underscore
makes Django's command loader skip this file while it stays importable as
`from ._seed_notes import SEED_CATEGORIES, SEED_NOTES`.

The notes deliberately share recurring threads (altitude/soroche, daily
budget, bus-vs-train transport, Peruvian food, the Bolivia border crossing) so
a single Ask-Your-Notes question retrieves chunks from more than one note.
"""

